{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]Out in the streets, their voices mix up
[Eb]With their versions [Db]of what's right
[Bbm]Scrolling through their [Ab]opinions that [Eb]never stop
[Db]Is this all there is to life?
[Bbm]They tell us, "Do what [Ab]feels good for you."
[Eb]But I've seen where [Db]that could lead
[Bbm]Dead ends and empty [Ab]roads that we're walking through
[Db]Could not give [Bbm]us what we need
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Fm]There is [Db]more to life
[Ab/C]Don't have to blend in, [Eb]no need to cave in
[Fm]Jesus [Db]is the life
[Ab/C]Come out of hiding, [Eb]and let the light in
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Who's with me?}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Db]Lift your [Ab]hands and [Eb]sing
[Ab/C]He's the Way, the Truth, the Life
[Db]In His [Ab]Name, we're free
[Eb] [Ab/C]I've seen dead bones come alive
[Db]Not a[Ab]shamed to [Eb]sing it loud
[Bbm]I was lost, but I've been found
[Db]So I [Ab]live for Jesus now
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Who's with me?}

